2.44, "w": 6.12, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "fraud", "x": 17.27, "y": 42.45, "w": 7.13, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "?", "x": 24.47, "y": 42.44, "w": 1.16, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "What is wrong with Nicholas II, for that matter, who", "x": 13.9, "y": 44.38, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "also \u201callowed\u201d", "x": 11.11, "y": 46.32, "w": 20.85, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "unequal", "x": 32.59, "y": 46.33, "w": 11.68, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "representation from the peasants", "x": 44.89, "y": 46.32, "w": 46.21, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "and  from  the  landowners??", "x": 11.11, "y": 48.23, "w": 36.41, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "By tolerating such things, we are prostituting democracy.", "x": 13.9, "y": 50.17, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "We must pass a resolution demanding", "x": 13.9, "y": 52.11, "w": 50.63, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "equal", "x": 64.95, "y": 52.13, "w": 7.64, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "suffrage (both", "x": 72.98, "y": 52.11, "w": 18.12, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "in the Soviets and at trade union congresses), branding the", "x": 11.11, "y": 54.05, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "slightest", "x": 11.11, "y": 56.01, "w": 11.93, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "departure from equality as a", "x": 23.5, "y": 55.99, "w": 39.44, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "fraud", "x": 63.44, "y": 56.01, "w": 7.27, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u2014using exactly", "x": 70.79, "y": 55.99, "w": 20.32, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "this word\u2014as", "x": 11.11, "y": 57.93, "w": 19.12, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "a Nicholas II method", "x": 30.73, "y": 57.95, "w": 28.99, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ". This resolution of the", "x": 59.79, "y": 57.93, "w": 31.31, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "plenary m